Portions of src/index.ts are derived from the in-tree Mastra server adapters,
principally @mastra/elysia (server-adapters/elysia). The behaviour carried over
includes the stream framing for both SSE and record-separated formats, the
error-swallowing forwarding stream, the stripping of Transfer-Encoding from a
forwarded response, the structure of the responseType dispatch, and the decision
not to await the MCP transport start call. Those portions remain under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

This package depends on Effect (https://github.com/Effect-TS/effect), which is
licensed under the MIT License and is a peer dependency rather than redistributed
here. A copy of Effect's source is vendored under docs/repos/effect as a git
subtree for reference only; it is excluded from the published package and remains
under its own license.
